Nobody talks about this part.

Building something from nothing…

is uncomfortable.

No roadmap.
No validation.
No guarantees.

Just a feeling that won’t leave you alone.

Some days it feels like clarity.
Other days it feels like chaos.

But you keep going.

Because deep down —
you know you’re not building it for attention.

You’re building it because it needs to exist.

